OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for new homes next to
OL,4,Acouncil headquarters
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans have been unveiled for 44 new
OL,7,Fhomes next to a city council's
OL,8,Fheadquarters.
OL,10,FThe 'Vaux Living Places' development,
OL,11,Fin Sunderland, would also include up to
OL,12,Fsix commercial units, proposals said.
OL,14,FIt is part of Riverside Sunderland, a
OL,15,Fregeneration scheme in the city centre,
OL,16,Ffeaturing housing, office and public
OL,17,Fspaces.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
